	<http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#bookmark> "false" ;
	<http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#mutableNotes> "<P> <P>BBa_E0022 cyan fluorescent protein is based on BioBrick part BBa_E0021. It      has been modified to include a rapid degradation LVA tail, and includes the      BioBrick standard assembly head and tail restriction sites. The RBS has been      removed. The stop codon has been changed from TAA to a double stop codon TAATAA.      <P>" ;
